     "type": "concept",
     "title": "Two Different IDs: Taxonomy vs. Medicare Specialty Code",
     "content": "People often mix these up.\n\n• **NPI taxonomy code 1041C0700X** (Social Worker, Clinical). This comes from the national NUCC taxonomy code set. It is on your NPI record, and some payers want it on the claim.\n• **Medicare specialty code 80**. This is Medicare's own internal label. The CMS Medicare Claims Processing Manual, Chapter 12, §150 says: \"CSWs are identified on the provider file by specialty code 80 and provider type 56.\"\n\nThe same section sets two payment rules for Medicare:\n\n• **Payment is 75% of the Physician Fee Schedule.**\n• **Assignment is required**, so you must accept Medicare's allowed amount.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">LCSW IDENTIFIERS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Taxonomy is national; specialty 80 is Medicare's</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"298\" width=\"488.0\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"348\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">NPI taxonomy</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"403\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">1041C0700X (Social Worker,</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"439\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Clinical).</text><rect x=\"562.0\" y=\"298\" width=\"488.0\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"348\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Medicare specialty</text><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"403\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Code 80, provider type 56.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"622\" width=\"488.0\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"672\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Medicare payment</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"727\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">75% of the Physician Fee</text><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"763\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Schedule.</text><rect x=\"562.0\" y=\"622\" width=\"488.0\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"672\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Assignment</text><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"727\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Required. Accept Medicare's</text><text x=\"602.0\" y=\"763\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">allowed amount.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Two Different IDs: Taxonomy vs. Medicare Specialty Code"
     }
